#@desc: The Vocabulary of the banquet: everything the game, the Agents and the Directors share.

# ── Propensities ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

TRAIT bravery.
MOOD sympathy, aggressiveness.

# ── Names ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

NAME wall, door, kitchen.
NAME roast, pie, bread.

# ── What the game produces ───────────────────────────────────────────────────

#@desc: The seat the game has laid for this Agent. Servants and Guards have none.
GAME FACT hall.seating.seat AS seat(place).
#@desc: Kept up to date by the game: learned as the evening goes on, forgotten after enough food.
GAME FACT hall.needs.hungry AS hungry.
#@desc: What the kitchen still has. The game forgets a dish when the last one is taken.
GAME FACT in_stock(dish).

#@desc: Sent by the game to an Agent with nothing to do.
GAME CUE hall.clock.idle AS idle.
#@desc: Sent by the game to an Agent close enough to see a cup being tampered with.
GAME CUE hall.senses.saw_pouring AS saw_pouring(person).
#@desc: Sent by the game when someone drinks from the poisoned cup.
GAME CUE hall.table.poison_drunk AS poison_drunk.

# ── Facts the Agents keep ────────────────────────────────────────────────────

#@desc: Seeded by Instancing. Guests add their own and make them bigger as the evening goes on.
FACT grudge(person, size).
FACT purse(gold), craves(dish), on_duty.
#@desc: Told between Guests: `victim` was wronged by `offender`.
FACT wronged(victim, offender).

# ── Cues Agents tell each other ──────────────────────────────────────────────

CUE insulted, scandal(person).
CUE served(dish), sold_out(dish).
CUE duel_on.

# ── Signals to the Directors ─────────────────────────────────────────────────

CUE took_seat, toast_given, finished_eating.
CUE insult_thrown(offender).
CUE duel_accepted, wagered(stake), handkerchief_dropped, duel_won.
CUE culprit_seized(person).

# ── Outcomes of the Subplots ─────────────────────────────────────────────────

CUE duel_settled(winner), duel_abandoned.
CUE poisoner_caught(person), poison_taken.

# ── Reasons ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

CUE no_food.                                 # `sold_out` is a Reason too, and also told

# ── Goals ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

GOAL take_seat, take_leave, open_feast, honour(person).
GOAL vent, resent(person).
GOAL have_dinner, bring(dish, place).
GOAL issue_challenge, fight, give_signal.

# ── Custom Actions ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

#@desc: Done when the Agent has arrived. Refused if the place can't be reached.
ACTION walk_to(place).
#@desc: Done at once. The game then removes the Agent, which leaves the Program.
ACTION leave_hall.
#@desc: Refused once the kitchen has run out of the dish.
ACTION pick_up(dish).
#@desc: Done when the dish is eaten. Called off, the Agent puts down what is left.
ACTION eat(dish).
#@desc: Refused at the table. Done when the sword is out.
ACTION draw_sword.
#@desc: Accepted at once; done only when the poison has dissolved in the person's cup.
ACTION pour_poison(person).
#@desc: The game's guards take hold of the person. Done once they hold them.
ACTION seize(person).
#@desc: The Target's own code, not the game's: done when that code returns.
ACTION hall.music.fanfare AS play_fanfare.
#@desc: For a Director: the game takes the poisoned cup out of play.
ACTION discard_cup.

ACTION sit_down, stand_up, stand_by(place), bow_to(person), raise_cup, toast(person).
ACTION chat, sip_wine, sneer_at(person), scowl_at(person), laugh, snigger, roll_eyes.
ACTION push_away(dish), complain, put_down(dish).
ACTION throw_glove, pick_up_glove, lunge, drop_sword, salute, limber_up.
ACTION cheer, hush(person), drop_handkerchief.
ACTION slip_away, watch(person).
ACTION open_doors, play_music, ring_bell, clear_tables.
